        "subject": "LU-9662 tests: skip sanity 60e when changelog is active",
        "message": "LU-9662 tests: skip sanity 60e when changelog is active\n\nsanity test_60e sets OBD_FAIL_MDS_LLOG_CREATE_FAILED2 and expects\nrm to succeed. The fail_loc also fails the changelog catalog, so\nwhen a changelog user is registered (left over from earlier suites\nin rolling upgrade/downgrade runs) mdd_changelog_ns_store() returns\n-ENOSPC and rm fails with -EFAULT.\n\nSkip the test when changelog users are registered, and reset\nfail_loc when the test ends.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ic8a50a789a055725489149a1c1442ed0387b6135\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
      "description": "Edit commit message"
    }
